  "headings": [],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "slideset",
      "source": "canonical",
      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "Tap the target button",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap the enemy mark, or the outline of an area drawn with <strong>Markers</strong> on <strong>Unknown</strong> or <strong>Enemy</strong>, then the target button, the crosshair on its ring. If ATAK first lists several items, tap the one you want.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/59ba9efb350f60c1.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Open the request",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Pick what you need. <strong>Send</strong> turns on once each choice has a pick.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/d989359bd731c828.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Pick and send",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Pick <strong>Strike</strong> or <strong>Recon</strong>, the priority and who to ask. Tap <strong>Send</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/ff890d64d77012b9.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Follow it in the Inbox",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap <strong>Inbox</strong>. Your request shows under <strong>Sent</strong> with the time you sent it.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/34b36a8935d3885b.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Read the answer",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Open <strong>Inbox</strong> again to see the answer on the same row, here <strong>Declined: weather</strong> with a blue dot. Tap the row to fly to the target.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/ba1697956dae7106.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Ask about an area",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>First draw and name the area with <strong>Markers</strong> on <strong>Unknown</strong> or <strong>Enemy</strong>, then <strong>Area</strong>. In <strong>Drones</strong> on <strong>My requests</strong> tap <strong>Ask for a drone</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/2bccbc76af2f13dc.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Tap the area",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap the area's outline. <strong>Back</strong> cancels.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/a98247db02e33873.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Recon comes picked",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>For an area <strong>Recon</strong> comes already picked. Pick who to ask and tap <strong>Send</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/a26009033e95b1bb.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
